1
00:00:00,714 --> 00:00:02,794
(Sheldon:)Or are we men
playing a fantasy card game...

2
00:00:02,966 --> 00:00:05,386
(Sheldon:)...set in a magical frontier town?

3
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:08,430
(Stuart:)Sorry.

4
00:00:08,597 --> 00:00:11,137
(Howard:)Creepy Tepee.

5
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:15,770
(Raj:)Annie Ogly.

6
00:00:17,356 --> 00:00:20,106
(Leonard:)Hocus Pocus Pocahontas.

7
00:00:20,317 --> 00:00:22,607
(Sheldon:)And may I point out,
it is the three of you...

8
00:00:22,778 --> 00:00:25,368
(Sheldon:)...who are obsessed
with Stuart and Amy, not me.

9
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:28,910
(Sheldon:)I think you need to ask yourselves
who's really being ridiculous here.

10
00:00:38,043 --> 00:00:39,423
- It's you.
- You are.

11
00:00:42,255 --> 00:00:43,385
(Raj:)Hey, guys, check it out.

12
00:00:43,548 --> 00:00:46,718
(Raj:)The deluxe limited edition
Wild West and Witches expansion pack...

13
00:00:46,885 --> 00:00:49,095
(Raj:)...in the signed and numbered
collector's tin.

14
00:00:49,262 --> 00:00:52,972
(Leonard:)Come on, no.
We just bought the regular pack.

15
00:00:53,141 --> 00:00:55,481
Ooh. A sheriff's badge. Ha, ha.

16
00:00:56,186 --> 00:01:00,026
(Raj:)Yeah, it's also a wand.

